# game/chapter_8.rpy:1567
translate brazil chapter_8_d6079758:

#   athna "But I got to him too late. His body isn't revivable right now."
    athna "Mas cheguei até ele tarde demais. Seu corpo não pode ser revivido agora."

# game/chapter_8.rpy:1569
translate brazil chapter_8_16acd11f:

#   athna "And if you think I'm going down to the underworld to beg Hades to give some mortal back, you'd be very mistaken, sweet thing."
